fields.analysis:
Forward-only by decision (documented in README, which solicits input from anyone needing bidirectional lenses).

Lives in ~/Projects/go-pkgs/go-cambria as its own module;

Knows only JSON + lenses -- no event/ledger/Endless concepts.

'next' was mis-named - the view shows the session's whole status (current task, parent, in-flight elsewhere, blocked, dependents), not just what's next - and its dominant use is a persistent live pane.

One shared renderer; remove 'session next' (unshipped, no alias needed);

'project next' to follow the same split later.

Reads/Bash outside stay allowed.

No --force bypass (gates-not-guardrails);

Full design in the plan.
